1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:09,419
So now we start cooking so the first thing that I did was take the brussels sprouts that were soaking in the vinegar and wash them and just pour them over some water.
现在开始做饭。我先把泡在醋水里的抱子甘蓝拿出来洗，又用水冲了一下。

2
00:00:09,419 --> 00:00:14,940
Same thing with the broccoli and the tomatoes and I laid the tomatoes out to dry.
西兰花和番茄也这样处理，然后我把番茄摆开晾干。

3
00:00:14,940 --> 00:00:20,029
After that I also added the proteins to a bowl and just started defrosting them under some water.
之后我把蛋白质食物放进碗里，用水解冻。

4
00:00:20,039 --> 00:00:26,840
And then we got to seasoning so I seasoned my broccoli with coconut aminos olive oil paprika and salt.
然后开始调味，我给西兰花加了椰子氨基酸调味汁、橄榄油、红椒粉和盐。

5
00:00:26,840 --> 00:00:34,850
And then I also just went ahead and coated them really well with my hands and made sure to start off with that in the airfryer.
我用手把调料裹匀，并先把它放进空气炸锅。

6
00:00:34,860 --> 00:00:38,760
Because it was the shortest one so 11 minutes at 400 fahrenheit.
因为它需要的时间最短，所以我用了华氏四百度，十一分钟。

7
00:00:38,760 --> 00:00:45,000
And then I started cutting the brussels sprouts this kind of takes a little while so I basically slice them in half.
然后我开始切抱子甘蓝。这稍微费点时间，我基本上先把它们切成两半。

8
00:00:45,000 --> 00:00:52,020
And then I kind of sliced them like this into small little pieces and I then seasoned everything the seasoning is pretty similar to the broccoli.
再像这样切成小块，然后给全部调味，调味和西兰花的差不多。

9
00:00:52,020 --> 00:01:00,060
So I did coconut aminos olive oil salt paprika cumin which I love and garlic powder and again coat it with your hands.
我加了椰子氨基酸调味汁、橄榄油、盐、红椒粉、我很爱的孜然和蒜粉，再用手裹匀。

10
00:01:00,060 --> 00:01:08,640
And I let that be and started on with my potatoes I preheated the oven to convect roast at 380 fahrenheit more or less.
先把它放一边，再处理土豆。我把烤箱预热到热风烘烤模式，大约华氏三百八十度。

11
00:01:08,640 --> 00:01:18,840
And then I started slicing the potatoes in round pieces and then I stacked them and cut them in half and added them all to a tray with some aluminum foil.
然后我把土豆切成圆片，叠起来再切半，全部放到铺有铝箔的烤盘上。

12
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:27,290
And I love the sweet potato recipe it's so simple just olive oil salt and cinnamon coated all of that and added that to the oven.
我喜欢这个红薯做法，特别简单，就用橄榄油、盐和肉桂，全部裹好后送进烤箱。

13
00:01:27,300 --> 00:01:33,180
At that point the broccoli was pretty much ready so I took it out of the airfryer and stored it into my tupperware.
那时候西兰花基本做好了，我就把它从空气炸锅取出，装进保鲜盒。

14
00:01:33,180 --> 00:01:39,840
And then added the brussels sprouts and air fried that for around 16 minutes if you need a little bit more time you can always add it to.
然后我放进抱子甘蓝，空气炸了大约十六分钟。她说如果还需要一点时间，也可以再加；字幕在 to 处不完整。

15
00:01:39,840 --> 00:01:46,620
After those veggies were done I did the same thing with rinsing the cauliflower and then I went on to season that.
那些蔬菜弄完以后，我同样冲洗了花椰菜，然后继续给它调味。

16
00:01:46,620 --> 00:01:52,620
This is also one of my favorite recipes super simple but delicious you just need to use the right seasonings.
这也是我最爱的做法之一，特别简单但很好吃，重点是用对调料。

17
00:01:52,620 --> 00:02:00,000
So I did olive oil green goddess seasoning which is optional salt turmeric paprika pepper garlic powder and the juice of one whole lemon.
我用了橄榄油、可选的 green goddess 调料、盐、姜黄、红椒粉、胡椒、蒜粉和一整个柠檬的汁。

18
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:04,440
Which is literally a game changer to make your cauliflower extra crispy.
作者认为，柠檬汁真的很有用，会让花椰菜格外酥脆。

19
00:02:04,440 --> 00:02:08,340
So I just let that be while the brussels sprouts were in the air fryer.
抱子甘蓝还在空气炸锅里时，我就把那份先放着。

20
00:02:08,340 --> 00:02:17,029
And in the meantime since I had freed up one of the largest bowls I added my kale to some filtered water with the vinegar.
同时，因为我腾出了一个最大的碗，就把羽衣甘蓝放到加了醋的过滤水里。

21
00:02:17,039 --> 00:02:22,260
Wow that was all cooking so the potatoes were in the oven the brussels sprouts were in the air fryer.
字幕写作 wow that was，语境像是在说所有东西正在烹调：土豆在烤箱里，抱子甘蓝在空气炸锅里。

22
00:02:22,260 --> 00:02:27,060
I started on to my next baked veggie dish which was a zucchini dish.
我开始做下一道烤蔬菜，是一道西葫芦。

23
00:02:27,060 --> 00:02:36,479
So I sliced up two zucchinis and added them to a tray with aluminum foil and then I added some red onions which I had already chopped before.
我切了两根西葫芦，放到铺铝箔的盘里，再加进之前已经切好的红洋葱。

24
00:02:36,479 --> 00:02:43,140
But you can chop your onions in a moment and I added some cabbage as well and all of the seasonings listed on screen.
她说也可以当时再切洋葱。我还加了卷心菜和画面里列出的所有调料。

25
00:02:43,140 --> 00:02:50,029
And then I added that as well into the oven at quebec roast 380 fahrenheit and just kind of let it be.
然后也放进烤箱，字幕模式写作 quebec roast，华氏三百八十度，就先让它烤着。

26
00:02:50,039 --> 00:02:55,140
And then I started on the next baked dish which was a butternut squash bake so easy.
接下来开始做另一道烘烤菜，是奶油南瓜烤菜，很简单。

27
00:02:55,140 --> 00:03:00,950
I just used the pre cut butternut squash I had bought seasoned it and then added that tray to the oven.
我用了买来的预切南瓜，调味后把那盘也送进烤箱。

28
00:03:00,960 --> 00:03:05,520
And I realized the potatoes were ready so I took them out and stored them.
然后我发现土豆好了，就取出来收好。

29
00:03:05,520 --> 00:03:10,250
At that point the brussels sprouts were ready so I took them out of the airfryer.
这时抱子甘蓝也做好了，我把它们从空气炸锅里取出来。

30
00:03:10,260 --> 00:03:18,779
And this is the key gotta add some hot honey some red pepper flakes and everything but the bagel seasoning to your brussels sprouts for the best freaking combination.
这是关键：她会给抱子甘蓝加辣蜂蜜、辣椒碎和 everything but the bagel 调味料，觉得搭在一起特别棒。

31
00:03:18,779 --> 00:03:21,709
In this world and shake it up so everything gets coated.
她说这是世界上最棒的组合，然后摇一摇，让每块都裹上调料。

32
00:03:21,719 --> 00:03:27,060
That was ready so then I air fried the cauliflower which was already prepped for around 20 minutes.
那份弄好后，我又把已经准备好的花椰菜放入空气炸锅，大约二十分钟。

33
00:03:27,060 --> 00:03:32,580
This one takes a little bit longer so while the cauliflower was cooking the rest of the veggies were in the oven.
这道需要的时间稍长一些。花椰菜烹调时，其余蔬菜还在烤箱里。
